	elif Utils.character.get_apprehension() >= 5
		Vicenzo: Overkill, if you ask me.
	else
		Vicenzo: That's an up-close-and-personal way to hurt somebody.
		- Personal because it was close?
			do Utils.register_dialogue_choice("vicenzo_opener_close", "Personal because it was close?", "evidence", 0.1, 0.0, "opener", 0.8, 0.0, -0.1, 0.0)
			Vicenzo: Close, messy, and driven by serious anger.
		- The killer wanted to make a point.
			do Utils.register_dialogue_choice("vicenzo_opener_point", "The killer wanted to make a point.", "evidence,family", 0.0, 0.1, "opener", 0.7, 0.0, -0.1, 0.1)
