~ blamed
if Utils.character.get_trust() >= 6 and Utils.character.get_joy() >= 1 and not Utils.ctx["is_suspicious"] and not Utils.ctx["is_pressured"]
	Vicenzo: ...Wow.
	Vicenzo: Okay. That one actually landed.
	Vicenzo: I thought you were flirting with the truth.
	Vicenzo: Turns out you were only flirting with me while building a case.
elif Utils.ctx["is_pressured"] or Utils.ctx["is_suspicious"] or Utils.character.get_trust() <= -4
	Vicenzo: There it is.
	Vicenzo: Knew you were walking me toward this.
	Vicenzo: You never really came back for me.
	Vicenzo: You came back for the version of me that made your story work.
elif Utils.ctx["family_focus"] >= 5 and Utils.ctx["blame"] >= 4
	Vicenzo: Because I am the secret son.
	Vicenzo: Because blood makes the room tidy for you.
	Vicenzo: Convenient.
elif Utils.ctx["is_self_incriminating"] and Utils.character.get_interest() >= 5
	Vicenzo: You know what is almost funny?
	Vicenzo: Half the time you sounded more afraid of yourself than of me.
	Vicenzo: And still you picked me.
elif Utils.ctx["is_stressed"] or Utils.ctx["is_confused"]
	Vicenzo: You look like you do not even believe yourself.
	Vicenzo: That is the cruel part.
	Vicenzo: You are throwing me overboard just to make the noise in your head stop.
else
	Vicenzo: So that is the end of it?
	Vicenzo: I get the blame, and you get to feel certain for one blessed second.
	Vicenzo: Must be nice.
=> END
